usage: qa_normalize_scan.py [-h] [--root ROOT] [--focus FOCUS]
                            [--all-markdown] [--format {markdown,json}]
                            [--self-test]

Read-only scanner for QA evidence normalization warnings.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --root ROOT           Workspace root for scanning and evidence resolution.
  --focus FOCUS         Optional narrower path to scan under --root.
  --all-markdown        Scan all Markdown files, not just report-like paths.
  --format {markdown,json}
                        Output format.
  --self-test           Run scanner self-test and exit.
